  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b-1",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Assessment"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**We’re looking for a Frontend Developer who’s excited about shaping a modern, AI-enhanced digital experience for our brand. You’ll work on revamping our company website to be faster, smarter, and more interactive — integrating AI features that improve UX, personalization, and efficiency.**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-3",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Some of the things you’ll do**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-4",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Develop, test, and maintain responsive and accessible web interfaces using React, Next.js, or Vue.Collaborate with design and backend teams to build cohesive, AI-integrated user experiences.Implement chatbots, recommendation engines, and automation tools powered by AI APIs.Optimize site performance and SEO for maximum visibility.Maintain component libraries and follow modern UI/UX best practices.Work with the product and marketing teams to design data-driven user experiences.**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-11",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-5",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Develop, test, and maintain responsive and accessible web interfaces using React, Next.js, or Vue."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-6",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Collaborate with design and backend teams to build cohesive, AI-integrated user experiences."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-7",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Implement chatbots, recommendation engines, and automation tools powered by AI APIs."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-8",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Optimize site performance and SEO for maximum visibility."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-9",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Maintain component libraries and follow modern UI/UX best practices."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-10",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Work with the product and marketing teams to design data-driven user experiences."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-12",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Requirements**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-13",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Strong proficiency in HTML5, CSS3 (Tailwind / Sass), and JavaScript/TypeScript.Experience with React, Next.js, or similar frameworks.Familiarity with integrating AI APIs (e.g., OpenAI, HuggingFace, or custom ML endpoints).Understanding of UX principles, cross-browser compatibility, and responsive design.Basic understanding of REST APIs, JSON, and web security best practices.A growth mindset — you love experimenting with new technologies.**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-20",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-14",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Strong proficiency in HTML5, CSS3 (Tailwind / Sass), and JavaScript/TypeScript."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-15",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Experience with React, Next.js, or similar frameworks."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-16",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Familiarity with integrating AI APIs (e.g., OpenAI, HuggingFace, or custom ML endpoints)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-17",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Understanding of UX principles, cross-browser compatibility, and responsive design."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-18",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Basic understanding of REST APIs, JSON, and web security best practices."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-19",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "A growth mindset — you love experimenting with new technologies."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}